acts.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n>=30 for lineup cells cited\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Jokic/Curry/Doncic/Giannis; min-15 gate on 8 play types; opposing DEFENSE_LINEUP ~84% coverage; 272-row CSV."}, {"id": "FAM:SF-PAP-034", "score": 0.086, "document": "# FAM:SF-PAP-034 | Study family SF-PAP-034: Position breakdown and Gobert sanity check on structural load\n- observed_research_question: Position breakdown and Gobert sanity check on structural load\n- auto_outcome_status: no result recorded\n- observed_hypothesis: Structural load is not an artifact of position or low initiation volume (Gobert vs other C/F-C; init<400 vs >=400).\n- observed_result: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: no result CSV/log of the printed tables was found\n- observed_sample_and_power: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Exploratory merge of fragility_full_loads with player_positions and initiation totals from paper2_full_edges.parquet.\n- observed_verdict: abandoned\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: Archive paper discusses Gobert as a low-usage hub but does not report this script's group means.\n- auto_confidence: low (0.15)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-155"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPM-022", "score": 0.085, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPM-022 | Study family SF-APPM-022: Superstar suppression profiles (incl. Q5c sequential triggering)\n- observed_research_question: Superstar suppression profiles (incl. Q5c sequential triggering)\n- auto_outcome_status: inconclusive\n- observed_hypothesis: Specific opposing lineups, defenders, play types and preceding opponent play types suppress star efficiency.\n- observed_result: Q5c verdict 'rank-1 suppressor varies meaningfully across players'; e.g. Jokic after opp POST_UP 1.1271 (-0.0675, SE +/-0.0500, n=480); Curry forced POST_UP -0.209.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: Rank-1 deltas mostly within 1-2 SE with no multiple-comparison control; OTHER artifact flagged in doc.\n- observed_sample_and_power: SE per cell reported\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-050\n- observed_verdict: inconclusive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)"}], "n_results": 4}

