    {
      "code": "SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER",
      "text": "148 spells but only 11 distinct absent players; player-level clustering may inflate type-I errors and reduces effective sample."
    },
    {
      "code": "CONFOUNDING",
      "text": "The teammate with smallest distance is almost certainly the primary substitute by position, so any gain may be entirely attributable to increased court time and coach role assignment, not a pure profile-matching mechanism."
